HELP=<<END
Search a source snapshot by meaning and return passages with file and line citations.
@param query Natural-language question.
@param [path] Relative file or directory to search; defaults to the source root.
@param [limit] Maximum results, from 1 to 100; defaults to 10.
@param [chunk-chars] Maximum Unicode characters per chunk, from 1 to 16384; defaults to 1200.
@param [run-salt] Force fresh execution for validation; normally leave unset.
END
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/worker --help=$HELP
